  "title": {
    "rendered": "Sportska masaža"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\u003Ch1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-xxlarge-font-size wp-elements-c292ed02d463f8d70afb9fbfcecc55af\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:1.9\"\u003ESportska Masaža\u003C/h1\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover has-parallax\"\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-1261 has-parallax\" style=\"background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-3.png)\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\"\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-4d1b7f680b4be8e2316a10a0c4451ddf\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);line-height:2\"\u003ESportska masaža: Brži oporavak i vrhunska izvedba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-600483041a0494be3eae0ccd22d8db9b\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);line-height:2\"\u003EBilo da si profesionalni sportaš, rekreativac ili osoba koja se suočava s intenzivnim fizičkim naporom na poslu, tvoji mišići zaslužuju posebnu pažnju. Sportska masaža nije samo tretman – to je ključni alat za održavanje tvog tijela u vrhunskoj formi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-4d8b8bd84b68b7fa3dad3f6789208f01\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003EZašto odabrati sportsku masažu?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\"\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:0;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:0;flex-basis:33.33%\"\u003E\n\u003Cfigure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border is-style-rounded\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-1-1-1024x700.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1274\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-1-1-1024x700.png 1024w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-1-1-300x205.png 300w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-1-1-768x525.png 768w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-1-1.png 1163w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /\u003E\u003C/figure\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column has-medium-font-size is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);line-height:2;flex-basis:66.66%\"\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-9eac637be43d8557dd3ded48547ce7cf\" style=\"color:#220b04;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0;line-height:2\"\u003EZa razliku od klasičnih tehnika, sportska masaža se fokusira na \u003Cstrong\u003Edublja tkiva i specifične mišićne skupine\u003C/strong\u003E koje su najviše opterećene. Koristim snažnije i ciljane zahvate kako bismo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cul style=\"color:#220b04\" class=\"wp-block-list has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-22ba3702aef1203006542e344e785ebb\"\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUbrzali regeneraciju:\u003C/strong\u003E Smanjili vrijeme oporavka nakon treninga ili napora.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPoboljšali fleksibilnost:\u003C/strong\u003E Povećali opseg pokreta i smanjili rizik od ozljeda.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUklonili mliječnu kiselinu:\u003C/strong\u003E Riješili se osjećaja &#8220;teških nogu&#8221; i mišićnog umora.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovećali cirkulaciju:\u003C/strong\u003E Osigurali bolji protok kisika i hranjivih tvari do tvojih mišića.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-11607d5017f1666ef54c06d8bcf4c35d\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2\"\u003EMoj pristup: Razgovor prije svega\u003C/h2\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-9e624147ffb371087ce4171c6303fd58\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);line-height:2\"\u003EVjerujem da svako tijelo ima svoju priču. Zato kod mene nema &#8220;šablonske&#8221; masaže. Prije svakog tretmana volim čuti na čemu si radio, gdje osjećaš zatezanje i koji su tvoji ciljevi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\"\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-bb5f68f3d02637ec519ad0e48a4edb84 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"color:#220b04;line-height:2;flex-basis:66.66%\"\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\"has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-99d198702bb97d8f3bbf24a01d734cc6\" style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);line-height:2\"\u003EŠto možeš očekivati:\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Col style=\"color:#220b04;margin-top:0;margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:0;margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" class=\"wp-block-list has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-c151054c0c14002ca85f67462fc8c8bd\"\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECiljani tretman:\u003C/strong\u003E Fokusiramo se točno na one točke koje ti stvaraju probleme.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStručnost i snaga:\u003C/strong\u003E Primjena tehnika koje prodiru duboko u mišić, ali uz stalnu komunikaciju o intenzitetu pritiska.\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESavjet za održavanje:\u003C/strong\u003E Nakon masaže rado ću ti dati savjet kako održati mišiće gipkima do idućeg susreta.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);flex-basis:33.33%\"\u003E\n\u003Cfigure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border is-style-rounded\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\"\u003E\u003Cimg loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"647\" src=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-4-2-1024x647.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1268\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;aspect-ratio:1.5827041866849691;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-4-2-1024x647.png 1024w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-4-2-300x189.png 300w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-4-2-768x485.png 768w, https://front2.edukacija.online/backend/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/sportska-4-2.png 1159w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /\u003E\u003C/figure\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n",
